00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.160
UDQ4K XL equivalents.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:36.040
The Google Q40 files are larger on disk than unsloss Q4K XL versions despite the nominally

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:41.240
