00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:14.100
The post argues that structured prompting, often viewed as a limitation, is actually what

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.620
production pipelines require.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:23.160
VLLM doctor is a new open source command line interface that pulls metrics from a VLLM

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:29.180
at metrics endpoint or Prometheus and runs rule-based checks for Q pressure, high time to first

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:34.560
token over time, per output token, and KV cache exhaustion across pods.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:40.640
Each diagnosis includes the triggering metrics, confidence level, likely causes, and

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.320
